<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Shipment Dispatched</title>
</head>

<body
style="
margin:0;
padding:0;
background:#f4f7fb;
font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
">

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr>
<td align="center">

<table
width="650"
cellpadding="0"
cellspacing="0"
style="
background:#ffffff;
margin:30px auto;
border-radius:12px;
overflow:hidden;
border:1px solid #e5e7eb;
">

<!-- Header -->

<tr>
<td
style="
background:#8751e4;
color:#ffffff;
padding:32px;
text-align:center;
border-bottom:5px solid #6d3fd4;
">

<h1
style="
margin:0;
font-size:28px;
font-weight:700;
letter-spacing:1px;
">

SHIPMENT DISPATCHED

</h1>

</td>
</tr>

<!-- Body -->

<tr>
<td style="padding:35px;">

<h2 style="margin-top:0;">
Hello <%= buyerName %>,
</h2>

<p style="line-height:1.8;">
Great news! Your shipment has now been dispatched and is on its way.
You can log in to your account to monitor shipment progress.
</p>

<table
width="100%"
cellpadding="10"
cellspacing="0"
style="
margin:25px 0;
border-collapse:collapse;
border:1px solid #ddd;
">

<tr>
<td><strong>Shipment ID</strong></td>
<td><%= shipmentInvoiceId %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Order ID</strong></td>
<td><%= orderId %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Product</strong></td>
<td><%= productName %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Quantity</strong></td>
<td><%= shippedQuantity %> MT</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Pickup Location</strong></td>
<td><%= shipmentFrom %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Delivery Location</strong></td>
<td><%= shipmentTo %></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><strong>Transporter</strong></td>
<td>
<%= transporterName || "Assigned Transport Partner" %>
</td>
</tr>

</table>

<div
style="
background:#eef7ff;
border-left:5px solid #0d6efd;
padding:18px;
border-radius:8px;
">

<strong>What's Next?</strong>

<p style="margin-bottom:0;line-height:1.8;">

Your shipment is now moving towards its destination.

You can track shipment updates from your Buyer Dashboard.
Once delivery is completed, you'll receive another notification.

</p>

</div>

<div
style="
margin-top:35px;
text-align:center;
">

<a
href="<%= frontendUrl %>/buyer-orders"
style="
background:#0d6efd;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
padding:14px 28px;
border-radius:8px;
display:inline-block;
font-weight:bold;
">

Track Shipment

</a>

</div>

</td>
</tr>

<!-- Footer -->

<tr>
<td
style="
background:#f3f4f6;
padding:25px;
text-align:center;
color:#666;
font-size:14px;
">

© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Rubber Scrap Mart

<br><br>

Thank you for choosing Rubber Scrap Mart.

</td>
</tr>

</table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>